@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
### The assistant analyses COMPLETED months, so it needs data from earlier months to say much.
### Add a few months of income/expenses (use past dates) before trying these.

### Everything, most urgent first, plus the health score
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assistant/advice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Overspending for a given month
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assistant/overspending?month=2026-10-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saving recommendations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assistant/saving-recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Spending trends over the last 6 full months (2 to 12)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assistant/spending-trends?months=6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Forecasts: balance and savings in 1, 3, 6 and 12 months, plus goal forecasts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/predictions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
